  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Bonus Action, you can expend a use of your Wild Shape to surround yourself with a 5-foot Emanation of ocean spray for 10 minutes. It ends early if you dismiss it (no action required), manifest it again, or have the Incapacitated condition.</p><p>When you manifest the Emanation, and as a Bonus Action on your later turns, you can choose another creature you can see in it. The target must succeed on a Constitution saving throw against your spell save DC or take Cold damage equal to a number of d6s equal to your Wisdom modifier (minimum of one die) and, if it is Large or smaller, be pushed up to 15 feet away from you.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
